  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "cell-modal-intro",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Lógica Modal S4\n\nEl sistema S4 extiende la lógica modal K con los axiomas:\n- **T**: $\\Box p \\to p$ (reflexividad)\n- **4**: $\\Box p \\to \\Box\\Box p$ (transitividad)\n\nEn S4 el operador $\\Box$ (necessarily) satisface la propiedad de iteración."
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-axiom-t",
      "type": "code",
      "profile": "modal.s4",
      "source": "check valid ([]P -> P)",
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-axiom-4-md",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Axioma 4: Iteración de necesidad\n\nEn S4 tenemos: $\\Box p \\to \\Box\\Box p$\n\nEsto refleja la **persistencia epistémica**: si algo es necesariamente verdadero,\nes necesariamente necesariamente verdadero."
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-axiom-4",
      "type": "code",
      "profile": "modal.s4",
      "source": "check valid ([]P -> [][]P)",
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-diamond-md",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Operador Diamante\n\nEl operador $\\Diamond$ (possibly) se define como $\\Diamond p = \\lnot\\Box\\lnot p$.\n\nEn S4: $\\Diamond\\Diamond p \\to \\Diamond p$"
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-diamond",
      "type": "code",
      "profile": "modal.s4",
      "source": "check valid (<><>P -> <>P)",
      "outputs": []
    }
  ]
}
